# Engine

Pure functions only. No FastAPI or SQLAlchemy imports. Pin behavior in `backend/tests/test_engine.py`.

```python
# Monthly: clamp day 31 to month-end — never roll into next month
effective_day = min(item.day_of_month, calendar.monthrange(d.year, d.month)[1])

# Bi-weekly: every 14 days from start_date (required)
(d - start).days % 14 == 0
```

- Statement total: expense `+`, refund `-`. Positive = owed / bank debit on due date.
- Bank loop per day: recurring, then one-off, then CC payments.
- Card cashflow: ignore charges before that card's first `statement_from`. On `payment_due`, subtract that cycle's total only.
- Incomplete recurring rows (`amount` or `day_of_month` null) do not fire.
